{"version":1,"content":"<p>據最新傳聞，蘋果明年推出的iPhone 20 Pro系列將在機身邊框上大量使用3D打印鈦金屬。來自中國的爆料者「定焦數碼」在微博上稱，蘋果計劃採用基於激光的鈦粉末3D打印工藝來製造部分中框部件，這一工藝有望顯著提升設備的耐用性。該爆料者對該消息的準確性似乎頗有信心，甚至建議關注者在明年新機發佈時翻出這條微博進行對照。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588224.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.958312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.639573+00:00","content_hash":"010d55226792849cd367d39eb25da7728b031fb963e69b2995455c323aa52c3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}